<title>USA: Cerplex names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Cerplex names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cerplex Group Inc on Tuesday named Stephen Hopkins as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Hopkins was previously a principal Nightingale &amp; Associates, a financial and business advisory management firm.</p>
<p>Hopkins replaces Chairman William Klein who was acting as interim chief executive since October. Klein remains in his role as chairman.</p>
<p>In June Cerplex said it plans to cuts 125 jobs in an attempt to return to profitability.</p>
